@section II. Functionality
@format 1
@fragment shared.synchronize-sections
@title Synchronize section state
@entry update

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[update] Synchronize live section representations <process>
- Refresh viewfinder sections and selection @ flow.PFlowSectionUpdate(...)
- Refresh map sections and selection @ flow.PFlowSectionUpdate(...)
- Notify the active workspace of the section list and selection @ flow.PFlowSectionUpdate(...)
> persist

[persist] Attempt keyframe and section persistence <process>
- Skip saving while section editing is locked, while restoring a sidecar, or without a source @ flow.PFlowSidecarSave(...)
- Request persistence of keyframes, scanned spans, and sections; waveform data is not saved here @ flow.PFlowSidecarSave(...)
- Try the source sidecar, then fall back to the keyframe cache when the sidecar refuses it @ key.LKeyframeSidecarSave(...)
> result

[result] Live section state synchronized <output>
= The live views and workspace model agree. The void save path does not report whether persistence succeeded; state may be in the sidecar, fallback cache, or neither after a logged exception.
